From: Nebur692 <nebur_692@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:30:00 +0100
Subject: Keep the object store until the post-RSHUTDOWN hooks

The bailout fix (0164) resets EG(objects_store) in the fast path of
shutdown_executor(), which runs before zend_post_deactivate_modules(). Xdebug 3.1
(the last release for PHP 7.x) frees the arguments it keeps on its function stack
from its post-RSHUTDOWN hook; when a request ends with frames still on that stack
(exit(), max_execution_time, a destructor or shutdown function that ends the
request) and Xdebug holds the last reference to an object, zend_objects_store_del()
writes into the NULL bucket array and the worker dies with SIGSEGV.

Reset the store in php_request_shutdown() right after the post-RSHUTDOWN hooks
instead: the next request still never sees the freed buckets, and the memory is
only released afterwards by shutdown_memory_manager(), as before the fix.
---
--- a/Zend/zend_execute_API.c
+++ b/Zend/zend_execute_API.c
@@ -298,8 +298,8 @@
 		zend_hash_discard(EG(function_table), EG(persistent_functions_count));
 		zend_hash_discard(EG(class_table), EG(persistent_classes_count));
 		zend_cleanup_internal_classes();
-		EG(objects_store).object_buckets = NULL;
-		EG(objects_store).top = 1;
+		/* The object store is reset in php_request_shutdown(), after the
+		 * post-RSHUTDOWN hooks: see the comment there. */
 	} else {
 		zend_hash_graceful_reverse_destroy(&EG(symbol_table));
 
--- a/main/main.c
+++ b/main/main.c
@@ -1935,6 +1935,15 @@
 		zend_post_deactivate_modules();
 	} zend_end_try();
 
+	/* 11.5. Reset the object store, so that nothing reaches the freed buckets
+	 * before the next init_executor(). On fast shutdown, shutdown_executor()
+	 * leaves it in place, as it did before the bailout fix: extensions built for
+	 * PHP 7.x, such as Xdebug 3.1, release the objects they still hold from their
+	 * post-RSHUTDOWN hook, and an empty store there crashes in
+	 * zend_objects_store_del(). The memory is only released below. */
+	EG(objects_store).object_buckets = NULL;
+	EG(objects_store).top = 1;
+
 	/* 12. SAPI related shutdown (free stuff) */
 	zend_try {
 		sapi_deactivate();
